incoming application call
    Track executing method and preserve call-chain reentrancy.
    Remove activity on completion, including signaled completion.
outbound object call
    Track target and selector while waiting for the reply.
    Raise transport failures and remote signals to the caller.
    Remove wait activity on every exit.

Carry optional sender identity on object sends. Record received normal calls and replies/errors with chain IDs. Debug configuration/read/commands and trace configuration/read use the control lane.

__nativeSnapshotJson is a control message so definition/state inspection remains available.

await: and awaitPromise: requests allow their requested waiting duration plus transport reply overhead.

Route __controlState through the inspection channel so layout export cannot deadlock against actions resolving owner receivers.

Control ownership reads/writes and validated configuration use the inspection channel with locked field snapshots/replacement. This lets layout saves complete while a control awaits its inherited receiver.
